_phrase":"","numeric_pct":null,"f_scale":0,"severity":false,"severity_phrase":"","subtype":null,"price":"","availability":"","approval":"","note":"\"Less than one percent\" was Purdue's sales script. Between 1999 and 2021 about 645,000 Americans died from opioid-related causes."}]}]}